  "m9": "Não adicionar dependência nova sem pedir ao dono do projeto.",
  "m10": "Use pnpm, not npm, in the mobile workspace.",
  "m11": "The release tag is created by CI only after the verify workflow passes.",
  "m12": "Rate limits live in Redis; never keep counters in process memory.",
